msgid "Trimmed Mean shown without trimming because the medians method is selected."
msgstr "由於選擇了中位數方法，顯示未截尾的截尾均值。"

msgid "Trimmed Mean and Winsorized SD use %.0f%% trimming."
msgstr "截尾均值和溫索化標準差使用%.0f%%截尾。"

msgid "Robust regression failed: %s"
msgstr "穩健迴歸失敗：%s"

